{"version":1,"content":"<p>網約車巨頭Uber宣佈正式推出「Uber Parking」停車預約服務，用户如今可以直接在Uber應用內搜索、預訂並支付停車位費用。這項新功能建立在Uber今年收購停車平台SpotHero的基礎之上，被視為該公司擴大出行服務版圖以及推動未來自動駕駛出租車發展的重要一步。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585660.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.363097+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T17:29:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"057daf2888f501c2a0c62aa13ef6464ce9e4f61deafb9ce9a03d241ecf626fda","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}